    guest --> browse & search & detail & register & login & googleLogin & forgot
    customer --> browse & search & detail & cart & checkout & orders & review & helpful & ticket & profile & build
    admin --> dashboard & products & combos & manageOrders & accounts & tickets & designs
    googleLogin -. "ủy quyền OAuth" .-> clerk
    forgot -. "gửi liên kết đặt lại" .-> resend
